t: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>本日<rt>ほんじつ</rt></ruby>は「</span><span class=\"s1\">THE MUSIC DAY</span><span class=\"s2\">」さんです！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>日向<rt>ひなた</rt></ruby><ruby>坂<rt>ざか</rt></ruby>は</span><span class=\"s1\">15</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby><ruby>台<rt>だい</rt></ruby>と</span><span class=\"s1\">19</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby><ruby>台<rt>だい</rt></ruby>に<ruby>出演<rt>しゅつえん</rt></ruby>させていただきます！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>の<ruby>楽曲<rt>がっきょく</rt></ruby>するのかは<ruby>観<rt>み</rt></ruby>てからのお<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しみということで、</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>の<ruby>曲<rt>きょく</rt></ruby>か<ruby>予想<rt>よそう</rt></ruby>しながら<ruby>待<rt>ま</rt></ruby>っていてください</span><span class=\"s1\">( ¨̮ )</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>是非<rt>ぜひ</rt></ruby>ご<ruby>覧<rt>らん</rt></ruby><ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さい</span><span class=\"s3\">👀</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>昨日<rt>きのう</rt></ruby>から「<ruby>日向<rt>ひなた</rt></ruby><ruby>坂<rt>ざか</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s1\">46</span><span class=\"s2\">おひさま</span><span class=\"s1\">Cafe</span><span class=\"s2\">」が<ruby>開催<rt>かいさい</rt></ruby>となっております！！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>表参道<rt>おもてさんどう</rt></ruby>・<ruby>大阪<rt>おおさか</rt></ruby>・<ruby>福岡<rt>ふくおか</rt></ruby>・<ruby>岡山<rt>おかやま</rt></ruby>の</span><span class=\"s1\">4</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>店舗<rt>てんぽ</rt></ruby>が<ruby>始<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>まりました！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">7/8</span><span class=\"s2\">〜</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>高尾<rt>たかお</rt></ruby>・<ruby>青森<rt>あおもり</rt></ruby>・<ruby>神戸<rt>こうべ</rt></ruby>・<ruby>広島<rt>ひろしま</rt></ruby>の</span><span class=\"s1\">4</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>店舗<rt>てんぽ</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">7/29</span><span class=\"s2\">〜</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>名古屋<rt>なごや</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">も<ruby>始<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>まるみたいです！！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>是非<rt>ぜひ</rt></ruby>お<ruby>時間<rt>じかん</rt></ruby>のある<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>に<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>ってみてください！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>もコラボメニュー<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたい</span><span class=\"s3\">🤤</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"